#| msgid "UNIX is born"
msgid "UNIX Born"
msgstr "UNIX lahir"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid "Thompson & Ritchie"
msgstr "Thompson & Ritchie"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid ""
"In 1969, [Ken Thompson](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ken_Thompson) and "
"[Dennis Ritchie](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dennis_Ritchie) started "
"working on [UNIX](http://www.unix.org/what_is_unix/history_timeline.html). "
"Initially written in assembler, it was soon rewritten in [C](https://en."
"wikipedia.org/wiki/C_(programming_language)), a language created by Ritchie "
"and considered high level."
msgstr ""
"Pada tahun 1969, [Ken Thompson](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ken_Thompson) "
"dan [Dennis Ritchie](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dennis_Ritchie) mulai "
"mengerjakan [UNIX](http://www.unix.org/what_is_unix/history_timeline.html). "
"Awalnya ditulis dalam bahasa assembler, kemudian ditulis ulang dalam bahasa "
"[C](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/C_(programming_language)), sebuah bahasa "
"yang dibuat oleh Ritchie dan dianggap sebagai bahasa tingkat tinggi."

#: content/_index.md:0
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "C++ was created"
msgid "C++ Created"
msgstr "C++ diciptakan"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid "Bjarne Stroustrup"
msgstr "Bjarne Stroustrup"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid ""
"In 1979, [Bjarne Stroustrup](http://www.stroustrup.com/bio.html) started "
"developing \"C with classes\", which would later become the [C++](http://www."
"softwarepreservation.org/projects/c_plus_plus/). In his opinion, it was the "
"only language of the time that allowed to write programs that were at the "
"same time efficient and elegant."
msgstr ""
"Pada tahun 1979, [Bjarne Stroustrup](http://www.stroustrup.com/bio.html) "
"mulai mengembangkan \"C with classes\", yang kemudian menjadi [C++](http://"
"www.softwarepreservation.org/projects/c_plus_plus/). Menurutnya, ini adalah "
"satu-satunya bahasa pada saat itu yang memungkinkan untuk menulis program "
"yang efisien dan elegan."

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid "Free Software Born"
msgstr ""

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid "Richard Stallman"
msgstr "Richard Stallman"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid ""
"In 1984, [Richard Stallman](https://stallman.org/biographies.html#serious) "
"started developing [GNU](https://www.gnu.org/gnu/about-gnu.html) (GNU is Not "
"Unix), a completely free operating system based on Unix, which was "
"proprietary."
msgstr ""
"Pada tahun 1984, [Richard Stallman](https://stallman.org/biographies."
"html#serious) mulai mengembangkan [GNU](https://www.gnu.org/gnu/about-gnu."
"html) (GNU is Not Unix), sebuah sistem operasi yang sepenuhnya bebas "
"berdasarkan Unix, yang merupakan sistem operasi berpemilik."

#: content/_index.md:0
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "The Linux Kernel"
msgid "Linux Kernel Written"
msgstr "Kernel Linux"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid "Linus Torvalds"
msgstr "Linus Torvalds"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid ""
"In 1991, [Linus Torvalds](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Linus_Torvalds) "
"created the [Linux kernel](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Linux_kernel) based "
"on [MINIX](http://www.minix3.org/), a version of Unix written by [Andrew "
"Tanenbaum](http://www.cs.vu.nl/~ast/home/faq.html). The emergence of Linux "
"has revolutionized the history of free software and helped to popularize it. "
"See the [25 Years of Linux Kernel Development infographic](https://web."
"archive.org/web/20190628003733im_/https://www.linux.com/sites/lcom/files/"
"styles/rendered_file/public/linux-kernel-development-infographic-2016.jpg?"
"itok=DqVqiplt)."
msgstr ""
"Pada tahun 1991, [Linus Torvalds](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Linus_Torvalds) menciptakan [kernel Linux](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Linux_kernel) berdasarkan [MINIX](http://www.minix3.org/), sebuah versi Unix "
"yang ditulis oleh [Andrew Tanenbaum](http://www.cs.vu.nl/~ast/home/faq."
"html). Kemunculan Linux telah merevolusi sejarah perangkat lunak bebas dan "
"membantu mempopulerkannya. Lihat infografis [25 Tahun Perkembangan Kernel "
"Linux](https://web.archive.org/web/20190628003733im_/https://www.linux.com/"
"sites/lcom/files/styles/rendered_file/public/linux-kernel-development-"
"infographic-2016.jpg?itok=DqVqiplt)."

#: content/_index.md:0
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "The first distros are born"
msgid "First Distros Born"
msgstr "Distro pertama lahir"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid "GNU & Tux"
msgstr "GNU & Tux"

#: content/_index.md:0
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "In 1993, the first free distributions begin to emerge, based in [GNU and "
#| "Linux](http://www.aboutlinux.info/2005/11/complete-concise-history-of-"
#| "gnulinux.html). A [GNU/Linux distribution](http://futurist.se/gldt/) is "
#| "usually formed by the Linux kernel, GNU tools and libraries, and more a "
#| "collection of applications."
msgid ""
"In 1993, the first free distributions begin to emerge, based in [GNU]"
"(https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/GNU) and [Linux](https://en.wikipedia.org/"
"wiki/Linux). A GNU/Linux distribution is usually formed by the Linux kernel, "
"GNU tools and libraries, and more a collection of applications."
msgstr ""
"Pada tahun 1993, distribusi bebas pertama mulai muncul, berbasis [GNU dan "
"Linux](http://www.aboutlinux.info/2005/11/complete-concise-history-of-"
"gnulinux.html). Sebuah [distribusi GNU/Linux](http://futurist.se/gldt/) "
"terdiri dari kernel Linux, alat dan pustaka GNU, dan lebih banyak lagi "
"kumpulan aplikasi."

#: content/_index.md:0
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Qt was created"
msgid "Qt Created"
msgstr "Qt diciptakan"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid "Qt logo"
msgstr "Logo Qt"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid ""
"In 1995, the Norwegian company Troll Tech created the cross-platform "
"framework [Qt](https://wiki.qt.io/About_Qt), with which KDE would be created "
"in the following year. Qt became the basis of the main KDE technologies in "
"these 20 years. Learn more about [Qt History](https://wiki.qt.io/Qt_History)."
msgstr ""
"Pada tahun 1995, perusahaan Norwegia Troll Tech menciptakan framework lintas "
"platform [Qt](https://wiki.qt.io/About_Qt), yang akan digunakan untuk "
"membuat KDE pada tahun berikutnya. Qt menjadi dasar dari teknologi utama KDE "
"dalam 20 tahun ini. Pelajari lebih lanjut tentang [Sejarah Qt](https://wiki."
"qt.io/Qt_History)."

#: content/_index.md:0
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "KDE was announced"
msgid "KDE Announced"
msgstr "KDE diumumkan"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid "Matthias Ettrich"
msgstr "Matthias Ettrich"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid ""
"In 1996, [Matthias Ettrich](http://www.linuxjournal.com/article/6834) "
"announced the creation of Kool Desktop Environment (KDE), a graphical "
"interface for Unix systems, built with Qt and C ++ and designed for the end "
"user. The name \"KDE\" was a pun on the graphic environment [CDE](https://en."
"wikipedia.org/wiki/Common_Desktop_Environment), which was proprietary at the "
"time. Read [the original announcement](https://www.kde.org/announcements/"
"announcement.php) of the KDE Project."
msgstr ""
"Pada tahun 1996, [Matthias Ettrich](http://www.linuxjournal.com/"
"article/6834) mengumumkan pembuatan Kool Desktop Environment (KDE), sebuah "
"antarmuka grafis untuk sistem Unix, yang dibuat dengan Qt dan C++ dan "
"didesain untuk pengguna akhir. Nama \"KDE\" merupakan permainan kata dari "
"lingkungan grafis [CDE](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Common_Desktop_Environment), yang merupakan produk berpemilik pada saat itu. "
"Baca [pengumuman asli](https://www.kde.org/announcements/announcement.php) "
"dari Proyek KDE."

#: content/_index.md:0
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "KDE One Conference"
msgid "KDE One Conference Held in Arnsberg"
msgstr "Konferensi KDE One"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid "Cornelius Schumacher's Archive"
msgstr "Arsip Cornelius Schumacher"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid ""
"In 1997, about 15 KDE developers met in Arnsberg, Germany, to work on the "
"project and discuss its future. This event became known as [KDE One](https://"
"community.kde.org/KDE_Project_History/KDE_One_(Developer_Meeting))."
msgstr ""
"Pada tahun 1997, sekitar 15 pengembang KDE bertemu di Arnsberg, Jerman, "
"untuk mengerjakan proyek ini dan mendiskusikan masa depannya. Acara ini "
"dikenal sebagai [KDE One](https://community.kde.org/KDE_Project_History/"
"KDE_One_(Developer_Meeting)) atau KDE Satu."

#: content/_index.md:0
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "KDE 1 was released"
msgid "KDE Beta 1 Released"
msgstr "KDE 1 dirilis"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid "KDE Beta 1 Screenshot"
msgstr "Tangkapan layar KDE Beta 1"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid ""
"The beta 1 version of KDE was [released](https://www.kde.org/announcements/"
"beta1announce.php) exactly 12 months after the project announcement. The "
"release text emphasized that KDE was not a window manager, but an integrated "
"environment in which the window manager was just another part."
msgstr ""
"Versi beta 1 dari KDE [dirilis](https://www.kde.org/announcements/"
"beta1announce.php) tepat 12 bulan setelah pengumuman proyek. Teks rilis "
"menekankan bahwa KDE bukanlah sebuah window manager, tetapi sebuah "
"lingkungan yang terintegrasi yang mana window manager hanyalah salah satu "
"bagiannya."

#: content/_index.md:0
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "KDE e.V. was founded"
msgid "KDE e.V. Founded"
msgstr "KDE e.V. didirikan"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid "KDE e.V. logo"
msgstr "Logo KDE e.V."

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid ""
"In 1997, [KDE e.V.](https://ev.kde.org/), the nonprofit that represents the "
"KDE community financially and legally, was founded in Tübingen, Germany."
msgstr ""
"Pada tahun 1997, [KDE e.V.](https://ev.kde.org/), sebuah organisasi nirlaba "
"yang mewakili komunitas KDE secara finansial dan hukum, didirikan di "
"Tübingen, Jerman."

#: content/_index.md:0
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "KDE Free Qt Foundation was created"
msgid "KDE Free Qt Foundation Created"
msgstr "KDE Free Qt Foundation dibentuk"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid "Konqi with Qt in its heart"
msgstr "Konqi dengan Qt di hatinya"

#: content/_index.md:0
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "The foundation agreement for the [KDE Free Qt Foundation](https://www.kde."
#| "org/community/whatiskde/kdefreeqtfoundation.php) is signed by KDE e.V. "
#| "and Trolltech, then owner of Qt. The Foundation [ensures the permanent "
#| "availability](https://dot.kde.org/2016/01/13/qt-guaranteed-stay-free-and-"
#| "open-%E2%80%93-legal-update) of Qt as Free Software."
msgid ""
"The foundation agreement for the [KDE Free Qt Foundation](https://www.kde."
"org/community/whatiskde/kdefreeqtfoundation.php) is signed by KDE e.V. and "
"Trolltech, then owner of Qt. The Foundation [ensures the permanent "
"availability](https://dot.kde.org/2016/01/13/qt-guaranteed-stay-free-and-"
"open--legal-update/) of Qt as Free Software."
msgstr ""
"Perjanjian dasar untuk [KDE Free Qt Foundation](https://www.kde.org/"
"community/whatiskde/kdefreeqtfoundation.php) ditandatangani oleh KDE e.V. "
"dan Trolltech, yang pada saat itu adalah pemilik Qt. Yayasan ini [memastikan "
"ketersediaan permanen](https://dot.kde.org/2016/01/13/qt-guaranteed-stay-"
"free-and-open-%E2%80%93-legal-update) dari Qt sebagai Perangkat Lunak Bebas."

#: content/_index.md:0
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "KDE 1 was released"
msgid "KDE 1 Released"
msgstr "KDE 1 dirilis"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid "KDE 1"
msgstr "KDE 1"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid ""
"KDE released the [first stable version](https://www.kde.org/announcements/"
"announce-1.0.php) of its graphical environment in 1998, with highlights as "
"an application development framework, the KOM/OpenParts, and a preview of "
"its office suite."
msgstr ""
"KDE merilis [versi stabil pertama](https://www.kde.org/announcements/"
"announce-1.0.php) dari lingkungan grafisnya pada tahun 1998, dengan fitur-"
"fitur utama seperti kerangka kerja pengembangan aplikasi, KOM/OpenParts, dan "
"pratinjau dari paket perkantoran."

#: content/_index.md:0
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Konqi developer"
msgid "Konqi Adopted"
msgstr "Pengembang Konqi"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid "Konqi"
msgstr "Konqi"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid ""
"In April 1999, a dragon is announced as the new animated assistant to the "
"KDE Help Center. It was so charming that it replaced the previous project "
"mascot, Kandalf, from version 3.x on. See the [KDE 2 Screenshot](/images/"
"kde2b3_5.png) showing Konqi and Kandalf."
msgstr ""
"Pada bulan April 1999, seekor naga diumumkan sebagai asisten animasi baru "
"untuk Pusat Bantuan KDE. Ia sangat menawan sehingga menggantikan maskot "
"proyek sebelumnya, yaitu Kandalf, mulai versi 3.x dan seterusnya. Lihat "
"[Tangkapan layar KDE 2](/images/kde2b3_5.png) yang memperlihatkan Konqi dan "
"Kandalf."

#: content/_index.md:0
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "KDE Two Conference"
msgid "KDE Two Conference Held in Erlangen"
msgstr "Konferensi KDE Dua"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid "Group Photo (Cornelius Schumacher's Archive)"
msgstr "Foto Bersama (Arsip Cornelius Schumacher)"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid ""
"In October 1999, the second meeting of KDE developers took place in "
"Erlangen, Germany. Read the [report](https://community.kde.org/"
"KDE_Project_History/KDE_Two_(Developer_Meeting)) on the KDE Two Conference."
msgstr ""
"Pada bulan Oktober 1999, pertemuan kedua para pengembang KDE berlangsung di "
"Erlangen, Jerman. Baca [laporan](https://community.kde.org/"
"KDE_Project_History/KDE_Two_(Developer_Meeting)) tentang Konferensi KDE Dua."

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid "The Kool Desktop Environment Becomes 'The KDE Desktop'"
msgstr ""

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid "KDE 2 logo"
msgstr "Logo KDE 2"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid ""
"From the [beta 1 version of KDE 2](https://www.kde.org/announcements/"
"announce-1.90.php) it is possible to perceive a project naming change. The "
"releases that once referred to the project as \"K Desktop Environment\", "
"began referring to it only as \"KDE Desktop\"."
msgstr ""
"Mulai dari [versi beta 1 dari KDE 2](https://www.kde.org/announcements/"
"announce-1.90.php), Anda dapat melihat adanya perubahan penamaan proyek. "
"Rilis yang tadinya menyebut proyek ini sebagai \"K Desktop Environment\", "
"kini hanya menyebutnya sebagai \"KDE Desktop\"."

#: content/_index.md:0
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "KDE Three Beta Conference"
msgid "KDE Three Beta Conference Held in Trysil"
msgstr "Konferensi KDE Tiga Beta"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid ""
"In July 2000, the third meeting (beta) of KDE developers occurred in Trysil, "
"Norway. [Find out](https://community.kde.org/KDE_Project_History/"
"KDE_Three_Beta_(Developer_Meeting)) what was done during the conference."
msgstr ""
"Pada bulan Juli 2000, pertemuan ketiga (beta) para pengembang KDE diadakan "
"di Trysil, Norwegia. [Cari tahu](https://community.kde.org/"
"KDE_Project_History/KDE_Three_Beta_(Developer_Meeting)) apa yang dilakukan "
"selama konferensi tersebut."

#: content/_index.md:0
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "KDE 2 was released"
msgid "KDE 2 Released"
msgstr "KDE 2 dirilis"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid "KDE 2"
msgstr "KDE 2"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid ""
"KDE [released](https://kde.org/announcements/1-2-3/2.0/) its second version, "
"featuring as main news [Konqueror](https://konqueror.org/) web browser and "
"file manager; and the office suite [KOffice](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"KOffice). KDE had its code almost entirely rewritten for this second version."
msgstr ""
"KDE [merilis](https://kde.org/announcements/1-2-3/2.0/) versi kedua, dengan "
"menampilkan berita utama peramban web dan pengelola berkas [Konqueror]"
"(https://konqueror.org/); dan paket perkantoran [KOffice](https://en."
"wikipedia.org/wiki/KOffice). KDE memiliki kode yang hampir seluruhnya "
"ditulis ulang untuk versi kedua ini."

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid "KDE Becomes 'The KDE Project'"
msgstr ""

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid "KDE 2.1 Splashscreen"
msgstr "Layar pembuka KDE 2.1"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid ""
"From the [release announcement](https://www.kde.org/announcements/"
"announce-2.1.2.php) of version 2.1.2 there is also a change of the "
"nomenclature. The announcements began referring to KDE as \"KDE Project\"."
msgstr ""
"Sejak [pengumuman rilis](https://www.kde.org/announcements/announce-2.1.2."
"php) versi 2.1.2 juga terdapat perubahan penamaan. Pengumuman tersebut mulai "
"menyebut KDE sebagai \"Proyek KDE\"."

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid "KDE Women Group Created"
msgstr ""

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid "Original design for Katie, KDE's new mascot"
msgstr ""

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid ""
"In March 2001, the creation of community women's group was announced. The "
"[KDE Women](https://community.kde.org/KDE_Women) aimed to help increase the "
"number of women in free software communities, particularly in KDE. Watch the "
"video [\"Highlights of KDE Women\"](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HTwQ-"
"oGTmGA) of the Akademy 2010."
msgstr ""
"Pada bulan Maret 2001, pembentukan kelompok komunitas wanita diumumkan. [KDE "
"Women](https://community.kde.org/KDE_Women) bertujuan untuk membantu "
"meningkatkan jumlah perempuan dalam komunitas perangkat lunak bebas, "
"khususnya di KDE. Tonton video [\"Highlights of KDE Women\"](https://www."
"youtube.com/watch?v=HTwQ-oGTmGA) dari Akademy 2010."

#: content/_index.md:0
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "KDE Three Meeting"
msgid "KDE Three Meeting Held in Nuremberg"
msgstr "Pertemuan KDE Tiga"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid "Group Photo of KDE Three"
msgstr "Foto Bersama KDE Tiga"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid ""
"In March 2002, about 25 developers gathered for the [third KDE meeting]"
"(https://community.kde.org/KDE_Project_History/"
"KDE_Three_(Developer_Meeting)) in Nuremberg, Germany. KDE 3 was about to be "
"released and the KDE 2 code needed to be migrated to the new library Qt 3."
msgstr ""
"Pada bulan Maret 2002, sekitar 25 pengembang berkumpul untuk [pertemuan KDE "
"ketiga](https://community.kde.org/KDE_Project_History/"
"KDE_Three_(Developer_Meeting)) di Nuremberg, Jerman. KDE 3 akan segera "
"dirilis dan kode KDE 2 harus dimigrasikan ke pustaka baru Qt 3."

#: content/_index.md:0
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "KDE 1 was released"
msgid "KDE 3 Released"
msgstr "KDE 1 dirilis"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid "KDE 3"
msgstr "KDE 3"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid ""
"KDE released its [third version](https://kde.org/announcements/1-2-3/3.0/), "
"showing as important additions a new print framework, KDEPrint; the "
"translation of the project for 50 languages; and a package of educational "
"applications, maintained by the KDE Edutainment Project."
msgstr ""
"KDE merilis [versi ketiga](https://kde.org/announcements/1-2-3/3.0/), dengan "
"tambahan penting berupa kerangka kerja percetakan baru, yaitu KDEPrint; "
"terjemahan proyek ke dalam 50 bahasa; dan sebuah paket aplikasi pendidikan, "
"yang dikelola oleh Proyek KDE Edutainment."

#: content/_index.md:0
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "KDE e.V. meeting"
msgid "KDE e.V. Meeting Held in Hamburg"
msgstr "Pertemuan KDE e.V."

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid ""
"In August 2002, there was a [meeting of board members of the KDE e.V.]"
"(https://ev.kde.org/reports/2002.php) that was essential to establish how "
"the organization works. At this meeting it was decided, among other things, "
"that the brand \"KDE\" would be registered and that new members should be "
"invited and supported by two active members of e.V.."
msgstr ""
"Pada bulan Agustus 2002, diadakan [pertemuan anggota dewan KDE e.V.](https://"
"ev.kde.org/reports/2002.php) yang sangat penting untuk menetapkan cara kerja "
"organisasi. Pada pertemuan ini diputuskan, antara lain, bahwa merek \"KDE\" "
"akan didaftarkan dan anggota baru harus diundang dan didukung oleh dua "
"anggota aktif e.V.."

#: content/_index.md:0
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "KDE 1 was released"
msgid "KDE 3.1 Released"
msgstr "KDE 1 dirilis"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid "KDE 3.1"
msgstr "KDE 3.1"

#: content/_index.md:0
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "In [version 3.1](https://kde.org/announcements/1-2-3/3.1/) the community "
#| "presented KDE with a new look, a new theme for widgets, called Keramik, "
#| "and Crystal as default theme for the icons. See [KDE 3.1 New Feature "
#| "Guide](https://kde.org/info/3.1/feature_guide_1/)."
msgid ""
"In [version 3.1](https://kde.org/announcements/1-2-3/3.1/) the community "
"presented KDE with a new look, a new theme for widgets, called Keramik, and "
"Crystal as default theme for the icons. See [KDE 3.1 New Feature Guide]"
"(https://kde.org/info/1-2-3/3.1/feature_guide_1.html)."
msgstr ""
"Pada [versi 3.1](https://kde.org/announcements/1-2-3/3.1/) komunitas "
"menyajikan KDE dengan tampilan baru, tema baru untuk widget yang disebut "
"Keramik, dan Kristal sebagai tema default untuk ikon. Lihat [KDE 3.1 Panduan "
"Fitur Baru](https://kde.org/info/3.1/feature_guide_1/)."

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid "Kastle Conference Held in Brno"
msgstr ""

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid "Group Photo of Kastle"
msgstr "Foto Bersama Kastle"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid ""
"In August 2003, about 100 contributors of KDE from various countries "
"gathered in a castle in the Czech Republic. The event was called [Kastle]"
"(https://akademy.kde.org/2003) and was the forerunner of Akademy, the event "
"that would become the international annual meeting of the community."
msgstr ""
"Pada bulan Agustus 2003, sekitar 100 kontributor KDE dari berbagai negara "
"berkumpul di sebuah kastil di Republik Ceko. Acara tersebut dinamakan "
"[Kastle](https://akademy.kde.org/2003) dan merupakan cikal bakal Akademy, "
"sebuah acara yang kemudian menjadi pertemuan tahunan internasional komunitas "
"ini."

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid "Akademy 2004 Held in Ludwigsburg"
msgstr ""

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid "Group Photo of Akademy 2004"
msgstr "Foto Bersama Akademy 2004"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid ""
"In August 2004, the [first international meeting of the community](https://"
"conference2004.kde.org/) took place. The event was held in Ludwigsburg, "
"Germany, and launched a series of international events called [\"Akademy\"]"
"(https://akademy.kde.org/) which take place annually since then. The event "
"got its name because it happened in the \"Filmakademie\" city film school. "
"See the [group photos](https://devel-home.kde.org/~duffus/akademy/) of all "
"Akademies."
msgstr ""
"Pada bulan Agustus 2004, [pertemuan internasional pertama komunitas ini]"
"(https://conference2004.kde.org/) berlangsung. Acara ini diadakan di "
"Ludwigsburg, Jerman, dan meluncurkan serangkaian acara internasional yang "
"disebut [\"Akademy\"](https://akademy.kde.org/) yang berlangsung setiap "
"tahun sejak saat itu. Acara ini dinamakan demikian karena diselenggarakan di "
"sekolah film kota \"Filmakademie\". Lihat [foto grup](https://devel-home.kde."
"org/~duffus/akademy/) dari semua Akademi."

#: content/_index.md:0
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "KDE 1 was released"
msgid "KDE 3.5 Released"
msgstr "KDE 1 dirilis"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid "KDE 3.5"
msgstr "KDE 3.5"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid ""
"[KDE 3.5 was released](https://www.kde.org/announcements/announce-3.5.php). "
"This version introduced several new features, among them, the SuperKaramba, "
"a tool that allowed customize your desktop with \"applets\"; the Amarok and "
"Kaffeine players; and the media burner K3B. See [KDE 3.5: A Visual Guide to "
"New Features](https://www.kde.org/announcements/visualguide-3.5.php)."
msgstr ""
"[KDE 3.5 dirilis](https://www.kde.org/announcements/announce-3.5.php). Versi "
"ini memperkenalkan beberapa fitur baru, di antaranya, SuperKaramba, sebuah "
"alat yang memungkinkan untuk mengkustomisasi desktop Anda dengan \"applet\"; "
"pemutar Amarok dan Kaffeine; dan media burner K3B. Lihat [KDE 3.5: Panduan "
"Visual untuk Fitur Baru](https://www.kde.org/announcements/visualguide-3.5."
"php)."

#: content/_index.md:0
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "First in-person post-Pandemic Akademy held in Barcelona"
msgid "First Akademy-Es Held in Barcelona"
msgstr ""
"Akademy pasca-Pandemi pertama yang diadakan secara langsung di Barcelona"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid "First Akademy-es photo"
msgstr "Foto Akademy-es pertama"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid ""
"In March 2006, the [first meeting](https://dot.kde.org/2006/02/10/akademy-"
"es-2006-barcelona) of Spanish KDE contributors took place in Barcelona. "
"Since then, Akademy-Es has turned into an annual event. Learn more about "
"[Spanish KDE contributors group](https://www.kde-espana.org/)."
msgstr ""
"Pada bulan Maret 2006, [pertemuan pertama](https://dot.kde.org/2006/02/10/"
"akademy-es-2006-barcelona) kontributor KDE Spanyol berlangsung di Barcelona. "
"Sejak saat itu, Akademy-Es telah berubah menjadi acara tahunan. Pelajari "
"lebih lanjut tentang [grup kontributor KDE Spanyol](https://www.kde-espana."
"org/)."

#: content/_index.md:0
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "KDE Four Core meeting"
msgid "KDE Four Core Meeting in Trysill"
msgstr "Pertemuan Inti KDE Empat"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid ""
"In July 2006, the developers of the KDE core libraries gathered in Trysill, "
"Norway, for the [KDE Four Core meeting](https://dot.kde.org/2006/06/26/kde-"
"libs-hackers-meet-kde-four-core). The event was a kind of successor to the "
"KDE Beta Three Conference and KDE Three Meeting and in it developers worked "
"on the development of KDE 4 and stabilization of some core libraries to the "
"project."
msgstr ""
"Pada bulan Juli 2006, para pengembang pustaka inti KDE berkumpul di Trysill, "
"Norwegia, untuk menghadiri [Pertemuan Inti KDE Empat](https://dot.kde."
"org/2006/06/26/kde-libs-hackers-meet-kde-four-core). Acara ini adalah "
"semacam penerus dari Konferensi KDE Beta Tiga dan Pertemuan KDE Tiga dan di "
"dalamnya para pengembang mengerjakan pengembangan KDE 4 dan stabilisasi "
"beberapa pustaka inti untuk proyek ini."

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid "Guademy Held in in A Coruña"
msgstr ""

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid "Group Photo of Guademy"
msgstr "Foto Bersama Guademy"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid ""
"In March 2007, several contributors of KDE and [Gnome](https://www.gnome."
"org/) met in A Coruña, Spain, an event which sought to establish a "
"collaboration between the two projects. The event became known as [Guademy]"
"(https://dot.kde.org/2007/03/28/guademy-2007-event-report), a mixture of "
"[Guadec](https://wiki.gnome.org/GUADEC), the name given to the Gnome event "
"with Akademy, KDE event name."
msgstr ""
"Pada bulan Maret 2007, beberapa kontributor KDE dan [Gnome](https://www."
"gnome.org/) bertemu di A Coruña, Spanyol, dalam sebuah acara yang bertujuan "
"untuk membangun kolaborasi antara kedua proyek tersebut. Acara tersebut "
"dikenal sebagai [Guademy](https://dot.kde.org/2007/03/28/guademy-2007-event-"
"report), gabungan dari [Guadec](https://wiki.gnome.org/GUADEC), nama yang "
"diberikan untuk acara Gnome dengan Akademy, nama acara KDE."

#: content/_index.md:0
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "KDE 4 Alpha 1"
msgid "KDE 4 Alpha 1 Released"
msgstr "KDE 4 Alpha 1"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid "KDE 4 Alpha 1"
msgstr "KDE 4 Alpha 1"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid ""
"In May 2007, [the alpha 1 version of KDE 4](https://www.kde.org/"
"announcements/announce-4.0-alpha1.php), codenamed \"Knut\", was announced. "
"This announcement showed a completely new desktop, with a new theme, Oxygen, "
"new applications like Okular and Dolphin, and a new desktop shell, Plasma. "
"See [KDE 4.0 Alpha 1: A Visual Guide to New Features](https://www.kde.org/"
"announcements/visualguide-4.0-alpha1.php)."
msgstr ""
"Pada bulan Mei 2007, [versi alfa 1 dari KDE 4](https://www.kde.org/"
"announcements/announce-4.0-alpha1.php), dengan nama kode \"Knut\", "
"diumumkan. Pengumuman ini menunjukkan desktop yang benar-benar baru, dengan "
"tema baru, Oxygen, aplikasi baru seperti Okular dan Dolphin, dan shell "
"desktop baru, bernama Plasma. Lihat [KDE 4.0 Alpha 1: Panduan Visual untuk "
"Fitur Baru](https://www.kde.org/announcements/visualguide-4.0-alpha1.php)."

#: content/_index.md:0
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "KDE 4 Development Platform"
msgid "KDE 4 Development Platform Released"
msgstr "Platform Pengembangan KDE 4"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid "Konqi developer"
msgstr "Pengembang Konqi"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid ""
"In October 2007, KDE announced the [release candidate](https://www.kde.org/"
"announcements/announce-4.0-platform-rc1.php) of its development platform "
"consisting of basic libraries and tools to develop KDE applications."
msgstr ""
"Pada bulan Oktober 2007, KDE mengumumkan [release candidate](https://www.kde."
"org/announcements/announce-4.0-platform-rc1.php) dari platform "
"pengembangannya yang terdiri dari pustaka dasar dan alat untuk mengembangkan "
"aplikasi KDE."

#: content/_index.md:0
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "KDE 1 was released"
msgid "KDE 4 Released"
msgstr "KDE 1 dirilis"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid "KDE 4.0"
msgstr "KDE 4.0"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid ""
"In 2008, the community [announced the revolutionary KDE 4](https://kde.org/"
"announcements/4/4.0/). In addition to the visual impact of the new default "
"theme, Oxygen, and the new desktop interface, Plasma; KDE 4 also innovated "
"by presenting the following applications: the PDF reader Okular, the Dolphin "
"file manager, as well as KWin, supporting graphics effects. See [KDE 4.0 "
"Visual Guide](https://kde.org/announcements/4/4.0/guide/)."
msgstr ""
"Pada tahun 2008, komunitas [mengumumkan KDE 4 yang revolusioner](https://kde."
"org/announcements/4/4.0/). Selain dampak visual dari tema default baru, "
"Oxygen, dan antarmuka desktop baru, yaitu Plasma; KDE 4 juga berinovasi "
"dengan menghadirkan aplikasi berikut ini: pembaca PDF Okular, pengelola "
"berkas Dolphin, dan juga KWin yang mendukung efek grafis. Lihat [Panduan "
"Visual KDE 4.0](https://kde.org/announcements/4/4.0/guide/)."

#: content/_index.md:0
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "KDE Community"
msgid "KDE Becomes the Community"
msgstr "Komunitas KDE"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid "Konqis community"
msgstr "Komunitas Konqis"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid ""
"From the [announcement of version 4.1](https://www.kde.org/"
"announcements/4.1/) on there was already a tendency to refer to KDE as a "
"\"community\" and not just as a \"project\". This change was recognized and "
"affirmed in the rebranding announcement of the following year."
msgstr ""
"Sejak [pengumuman versi 4.1](https://www.kde.org/announcements/4.1/) sudah "
"ada kecenderungan untuk menyebut KDE sebagai \"komunitas\" dan bukan hanya "
"sebagai \"proyek\". Perubahan ini diakui dan ditegaskan pada pengumuman "
"perubahan nama pada tahun berikutnya."

#: content/_index.md:0
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "First Camp KDE"
msgid "First Camp KDE Held in Negril"
msgstr "Kemah Pertama KDE"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid "Group Photo of 2009"
msgstr "Foto Bersama 2009"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid ""
"In January 2009, [the first edition of Camp KDE](https://techbase.kde.org/"
"Events/CampKDE/2009) took place in Negril, Jamaica. It was the first KDE "
"event in the Americas. After that, there were two more US-based conferences, "
"[in 2010 in San Diego](https://dot.kde.org/2010/01/17/day-one-camp-"
"kde-2010), and another [in 2011 in San Francisco](https://dot.kde."
"org/2011/04/13/re-live-camp-kde-experience)."
msgstr ""
"Pada bulan Januari 2009, [edisi pertama Kemah KDE](https://techbase.kde.org/"
"Events/CampKDE/2009) berlangsung di Negril, Jamaika. Itu adalah acara KDE "
"pertama di Amerika. Setelah itu, ada dua konferensi yang berbasis di Amerika "
"Serikat, [pada tahun 2010 di San Diego](https://dot.kde.org/2010/01/17/day-"
"one-camp-kde-2010), dan satu lagi [pada tahun 2011 di San Francisco](https://"
"dot.kde.org/2011/04/13/re-live-camp-kde-experience)."

#: content/_index.md:0
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Gran Canaria Desktop Summit"
msgid "Gran Canaria Desktop Summit Held in... Gran Canaria"
msgstr "Gran Canaria Desktop Summit"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid "Group Photo of DS 2009"
msgstr "Foto Kelompok DS 2009"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid ""
"In July 2009, the first [Desktop Summit](http://www.grancanariadesktopsummit."
"org/), a joint conference of the KDE and Gnome communities, took place in "
"Gran Canaria, Spain. The [Akademy 2009](https://dot.kde.org/2009/07/14/"
"vibrant-community-propels-kde-forward-akademy-2009) was held with this event."
msgstr ""
"Pada bulan Juli 2009, [Desktop Summit](http://www.grancanariadesktopsummit."
"org/) yang pertama, sebuah konferensi gabungan dari komunitas KDE dan Gnome, "
"berlangsung di Gran Canaria, Spanyol. Acara [Akademy 2009](https://dot.kde."
"org/2009/07/14/vibrant-community-propels-kde-forward-akademy-2009) diadakan "
"bersamaan dengan acara ini."

#: content/_index.md:0
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "1 million of commits"
msgid "1 Million Commits Reached"
msgstr "1 juta commit"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid "Active contributors at the time"
msgstr "Kontributor aktif pada saat itu"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid ""
"The community [reached the mark of 1 million of commits](https://dot.kde."
"org/2009/07/20/kde-reaches-1000000-commits-its-subversion-repository). From "
"500,000 in January 2006 and 750,000 in December 2007, only 19 months later, "
"contributions reached the 1 million mark. The increase in these "
"contributions coincides with the launch of innovative KDE 4."
msgstr ""
"Komunitas [mencapai angka 1 juta commit](https://dot.kde.org/2009/07/20/kde-"
"reaches-1000000-commits-its-subversion-repository). Dari 500.000 pada "
"Januari 2006 dan 750.000 pada Desember 2007, hanya dalam waktu 19 bulan, "
"kontribusi telah mencapai angka 1 juta. Peningkatan kontribusi ini "
"bertepatan dengan peluncuran KDE 4 yang inovatif."

#: content/_index.md:0
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "First Randa Meetings"
msgid "First Randa Meetings Held"
msgstr "Pertemuan Randa yang Pertama"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid "Group photo of first RM"
msgstr "Foto bersama RM pertama"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid ""
"In September 2009, [the first](https://dot.kde.org/2009/09/08/third-plasma-"
"summit-lifts-kde-desktop-higher-grounds) of a series of events known as "
"[Randa Meetings](https://community.kde.org/Sprints/Randa) took place in "
"Randa, in Swiss Alps. The event brought together several sprints of various "
"community projects. Since then, Randa Meetings take place annually."
msgstr ""
"Pada bulan September 2009, [yang pertama](https://dot.kde.org/2009/09/08/"
"third-plasma-summit-lifts-kde-desktop-higher-grounds) dari serangkaian acara "
"yang dikenal sebagai [Randa Meetings](https://community.kde.org/Sprints/"
"Randa) berlangsung di Randa, di Pegunungan Alpen Swiss. Acara ini "
"mempertemukan beberapa sprint dari berbagai proyek komunitas. Sejak saat "
"itu, Randa Meetings diadakan setiap tahun."

#: content/_index.md:0
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Rebranding"
msgid "KDE Rebranded"
msgstr "Rebranding"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid "Brand graph"
msgstr "Grafik merek"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid ""
"In November 2009, the community [announced](https://dot.kde.org/2009/11/24/"
"repositioning-kde-brand) changes to its brand. The name \"K Desktop "
"Environment\" had become ambiguous and obsolete and is replaced by \"KDE\". "
"The name \"KDE\" is no longer just referring to a desktop environment, but "
"now represents both the community and the project umbrella supported by this "
"community."
msgstr ""
"Pada bulan November 2009, komunitas ini [mengumumkan](https://dot.kde."
"org/2009/11/24/repositioning-kde-brand) perubahan pada mereknya. Nama \"K "
"Desktop Environment\" telah menjadi rancu dan usang dan digantikan oleh \"KDE"
"\". Nama \"KDE\" tidak lagi hanya mengacu pada lingkungan desktop, tetapi "
"sekarang mewakili komunitas dan payung proyek yang didukung oleh komunitas "
"ini."

#: content/_index.md:0
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "KDE Software Compilation"
msgid "KDE Software Compilation Becomes a \"Thing\""
msgstr "KDE Software Compilation"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid "Brand Map"
msgstr "Peta Merek"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid ""
"From [version 4.3.4](https://www.kde.org/announcements/announce-4.3.4.php) "
"on, KDE announcements began to refer to the whole suite of products as 'KDE "
"Software Compilation' (KDE SC). Currently, this trend is abandoned."
msgstr ""
"Sejak [versi 4.3.4](https://www.kde.org/announcements/announce-4.3.4.php), "
"pengumuman KDE mulai merujuk seluruh rangkaian produk sebagai 'KDE Software "
"Compilation' (KDE SC). Saat ini, tren ini sudah ditinggalkan."

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid "Akademy-Br Held in Salvador"
msgstr ""

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid "Group Photo of Akademy-Br"
msgstr "Foto Bersama Akademy-Br"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid ""
"In April 2010, [the first meeting](http://ev.kde.org/reports/ev-"
"quarterly-2010Q2.pdf) of Brazil KDE contributors took place. The event was "
"held in Salvador, Bahia, and was the only Brazilian Akademy edition. From "
"2012 on, the event expanded to a meeting for all Latin American contributors."
msgstr ""
"Pada bulan April 2010, [pertemuan pertama](http://ev.kde.org/reports/ev-"
"quarterly-2010Q2.pdf) kontributor KDE Brasil berlangsung. Acara ini diadakan "
"di Salvador, Bahia, dan merupakan satu-satunya edisi Akademy Brasil. Mulai "
"tahun 2012, acara ini diperluas menjadi pertemuan untuk semua kontributor "
"Amerika Latin."

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid "'Join the Game' Program Announced"
msgstr ""

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid "JtG logo"
msgstr "Logo JtG"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid ""
"In June 2010, the KDE e.V. announced the supporting membership program "
"[\"Join the Game\"](https://jointhegame.kde.org/), which aims to encourage "
"financial support to the community. By participating in the program you "
"become a member of the KDE e.V., contributing to an annual amount and being "
"able participate in the organization's annual meetings."
msgstr ""
"Pada bulan Juni 2010, KDE e.V. mengumumkan program keanggotaan pendukung "
"[\"Join the Game\"](https://jointhegame.kde.org/), yang bertujuan untuk "
"mendorong dukungan finansial kepada komunitas. Dengan berpartisipasi dalam "
"program ini, Anda menjadi anggota KDE e.V., menyumbang sejumlah dana tahunan "
"dan dapat berpartisipasi dalam pertemuan tahunan organisasi."

#: content/_index.md:0
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "KDE 1 was released"
msgid "KDE SC 4.5 Released"
msgstr "KDE 1 dirilis"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid "Plasma Netbook screenshot"
msgstr "Tangkapan layar Netbook Plasma"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid ""
"In August 2010, the community [announced version 4.5](https://www.kde.org/"
"announcements/4.5/) of its products: Development Platform, Applications and "
"Plasma Workspaces. Each of them began to have a separate release "
"announcement. One of the highlights of this version was the Plasma interface "
"for netbooks, announced in version 4.4."
msgstr ""
"Pada bulan Agustus 2010, komunitas [mengumumkan versi 4.5](https://www.kde."
"org/announcements/4.5/) dari produknya: Platform Pengembangan, Aplikasi dan "
"Plasma Workspace. Masing-masing mulai memiliki pengumuman rilis yang "
"terpisah. Salah satu yang menarik dari versi ini adalah antarmuka Plasma "
"untuk netbook, yang diumumkan pada versi 4.4."

#: content/_index.md:0
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Calligra Suite logo"
msgid "Calligra Suite Announced"
msgstr "Logo Calligra Suite"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid "Calligra Suite logo"
msgstr "Logo Calligra Suite"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid ""
"In December 2010, the community [announces](https://dot.kde.org/2010/12/06/"
"kde-announces-calligra-suite) the [Calligra Suite](https://www.calligra."
"org/), a split from the KOffice suite. KOffice was discontinued in 2011."
msgstr ""
"Pada bulan Desember 2010, komunitas [mengumumkan](https://dot.kde."
"org/2010/12/06/kde-announces-calligra-suite) [Calligra Suite](https://www."
"calligra.org/), sebuah pemisahan dari KOffice suite. KOffice dihentikan pada "
"tahun 2011."

#: content/_index.md:0
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "First Conf KDE India"
msgid "First Conf KDE in India"
msgstr "Konferensi Pertama KDE India"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid "Group Photo of Conf India"
msgstr "Foto Bersama Conf India"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid ""
"In March 2011, the [first conference](https://dot.kde.org/2010/12/28/"
"confkdein-first-kde-conference-india) of the KDE and Qt community in India "
"took place in Bengaluru. Since then, the event has taken place annually."
msgstr ""
"Pada bulan Maret 2011, [konferensi pertama](https://dot.kde.org/2010/12/28/"
"confkdein-first-kde-conference-india) komunitas KDE dan Qt di India "
"berlangsung di Bengaluru. Sejak saat itu, acara ini telah berlangsung setiap "
"tahun."

#: content/_index.md:0
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Desktop Summit 2011"
msgid "Desktop Summit 2011 Held in Berlin"
msgstr "Desktop Summit 2011"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid "Group Photo of DS 2011"
msgstr "Foto Bersama DS 2011"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid ""
"In August 2011, [another joint conference](https://desktopsummit.org/) of "
"the KDE and Gnome communities took place in Berlin, Germany. Nearly 800 "
"contributors from all over the world came together to share ideas and "
"collaborate on various free software projects."
msgstr ""
"Pada bulan Agustus 2011, [konferensi gabungan](https://desktopsummit.org/) "
"dari komunitas KDE dan Gnome berlangsung di Berlin, Jerman. Hampir 800 "
"kontributor dari seluruh dunia berkumpul untuk berbagi ide dan berkolaborasi "
"dalam berbagai proyek perangkat lunak bebas."

#: content/_index.md:0
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Plasma Active 1 screenshot"
msgid "Plasma Active for Mobile Announced"
msgstr "Tangkapan layar Plasma Active 1"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid "Plasma Active 1 screenshot"
msgstr "Tangkapan layar Plasma Active 1"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid ""
"The community released the first version of its interface for mobile "
"devices, [Plasma Active](https://www.kde.org/announcements/plasma-active-"
"one/). Later, it was superseded by Plasma Mobile."
msgstr ""
"Komunitas ini merilis versi pertama antarmuka untuk perangkat seluler, "
"[Plasma Active](https://www.kde.org/announcements/plasma-active-one/). "
"Kemudian, digantikan oleh Plasma Mobile."

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid "First LaKademy Held in Porto Alegre"
msgstr ""

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid "Group Photo of LaKademy 2012"
msgstr "Foto Bersama LaKademy 2012"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid ""
"In April 2012, the [first meeting](https://lakademy.kde.org/lakademy12-en."
"html) of the KDE contributors in Latin America, LaKademy, took place. The "
"event was held in Porto Alegre, Brazil. The [second edition](https://br.kde."
"org/lakademy-2014) took place in 2014 in São Paulo, and since then has been "
"an annual event. So far, all editions were held in Brazil, where the highest "
"number of contributors from the Latin American community is based."
msgstr ""
"Pada bulan April 2012, [pertemuan pertama](https://lakademy.kde.org/"
"lakademy12-en.html) kontributor KDE di Amerika Latin, LaKademy, berlangsung. "
"Acara ini diadakan di Porto Alegre, Brasil. [Edisi kedua](https://br.kde.org/"
"lakademy-2014) diadakan pada tahun 2014 di São Paulo, dan sejak saat itu "
"menjadi acara tahunan. Sejauh ini, semua edisi diadakan di Brasil, yang "
"menjadi basis jumlah kontributor tertinggi dari komunitas Amerika Latin."

#: content/_index.md:0
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "KDE Manifesto"
msgid "KDE Manifesto Published"
msgstr "Manifesto KDE"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid "KDE Manifesto Art"
msgstr "KDE Manifesto Art"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid ""
"[KDE Manifesto](https://manifesto.kde.org/index.html), a document that "
"presents the benefits and obligations of a KDE project, was released. It "
"also introduces the core values that guide the community: Open Governance, "
"Free Software, Inclusivity, Innovation, Common Ownership, and End-User Focus."
msgstr ""
"[Manifesto KDE](https://manifesto.kde.org/index.html), sebuah dokumen yang "
"menyajikan manfaat dan kewajiban proyek KDE, telah dirilis. Dokumen ini juga "
"memperkenalkan nilai-nilai inti yang memandu komunitas: Tata Kelola Terbuka, "
"Perangkat Lunak Bebas, Inklusifitas, Inovasi, Kepemilikan Bersama, dan Fokus "
"Pengguna Akhir."

#: content/_index.md:0
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Konqi developer"
msgid "Konqi Get a Makeover"
msgstr "Pengembang Konqi"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid "Konqi redesigned"
msgstr "Konqi didesain ulang"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid ""
"In December 2012, the community [launched a competition](https://dot.kde."
"org/2012/12/08/contest-create-konqi-krita) to create a new mascot using "
"Krita. The competition winner was Tyson Tan, who created [new looks for the "
"Konqi and Katie](http://tysontan.deviantart.com/art/Konqi-ver-2-494267237)."
msgstr ""
"Pada bulan Desember 2012, komunitas ini [meluncurkan sebuah kompetisi]"
"(https://dot.kde.org/2012/12/08/contest-create-konqi-krita) untuk membuat "
"maskot baru menggunakan Krita. Pemenang kompetisi ini adalah Tyson Tan, yang "
"menciptakan [penampilan baru untuk Konqi dan Katie](http://tysontan."
"deviantart.com/art/Konqi-ver-2-494267237)."

#: content/_index.md:0
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Release cycle change"
msgid "Release Cycles Change"
msgstr "Perubahan siklus rilis"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid "Graph of the KDE technologies separated"
msgstr "Grafik teknologi KDE yang terpisah"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid ""
"In September 2013, the community [announced](https://dot.kde.org/2013/09/04/"
"kde-release-structure-evolves) changes in the release cycle of its products. "
"Each of them, Workspaces, Applications, and Platform, now have separate "
"releases. The change was already a reflection of the restructuring of KDE "
"technologies. This restructuring resulted in the next generation of "
"community products, which would be released the following year."
msgstr ""
"Pada bulan September 2013, komunitas ini [mengumumkan](https://dot.kde."
"org/2013/09/04/kde-release-structure-evolves) perubahan dalam siklus rilis "
"produknya. Masing-masing dari mereka, Workspace, Aplikasi, dan Platform, "
"sekarang memiliki rilis terpisah. Perubahan ini merupakan cerminan dari "
"restrukturisasi teknologi KDE. Restrukturisasi ini menghasilkan produk "
"komunitas generasi berikutnya, yang akan dirilis pada tahun berikutnya."

#: content/_index.md:0
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Frameworks 5"
msgid "Frameworks 5 Released"
msgstr "Frameworks 5"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid "Evolution of development of KDE technologies"
msgstr "Evolusi pengembangan teknologi KDE"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid ""
"The first stable version of Frameworks 5 (KF5), the successor of KDE "
"Platform 4, [was released](https://www.kde.org/announcements/kde-"
"frameworks-5.0.php). This new generation of the KDE libraries based on Qt 5 "
"has made the KDE development platform more modular and facilitated cross-"
"platform development."
msgstr ""
"Versi stabil pertama dari Frameworks 5 (KF5), penerus KDE Platform 4, [telah "
"dirilis](https://www.kde.org/announcements/kde-frameworks-5.0.php). Generasi "
"baru dari pustaka KDE yang berbasiskan Qt 5 ini telah membuat platform "
"pengembangan KDE menjadi lebih modular dan memfasilitasi pengembangan lintas "
"platform."

#: content/_index.md:0
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Plasma 5 screenshot"
msgid "Plasma 5 Released"
msgstr "Tangkapan layar Plasma 5"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid "Plasma 5 screenshot"
msgstr "Tangkapan layar Plasma 5"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid ""
"[Release](https://www.kde.org/announcements/plasma5.0/) of the first stable "
"version of Plasma 5. This new generation of Plasma has a new theme, Breeze. "
"Changes include a migration to a new, fully hardware-accelerated graphics "
"stack centered around an OpenGL(ES) scenegraph. This version of Plasma uses "
"as base the Qt 5 and Frameworks 5."
msgstr ""
"[Rilis](https://www.kde.org/announcements/plasma5.0/) versi stabil pertama "
"dari Plasma 5. Generasi baru Plasma ini memiliki tema baru, Breeze. "
"Perubahan termasuk migrasi ke stack grafis baru yang sepenuhnya diakselerasi "
"oleh perangkat keras yang berpusat di sekitar skenegraf OpenGL(ES). Versi "
"Plasma ini menggunakan basis Qt 5 dan Frameworks 5."

#: content/_index.md:0
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "GCompris joins the KDE"
msgid "GCompris Joins KDE"
msgstr "GCompris bergabung dengan KDE"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid "GCompris logo"
msgstr "Logo GCompris"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid ""
"In December 2014, the educational software suite [GCompris joins](https://"
"dot.kde.org/2014/12/11/gcompris-joins-kde-incubator-and-launches-fundraiser) "
"the [project incubator of KDE community](https://community.kde.org/"
"Incubator). Bruno Coudoin, who created the [project](http://gcompris.net/"
"index-en.html) in 2000, decided to rewrite it in Qt Quick to facilitate its "
"use on mobile platforms. It was originally written in GTK+."
msgstr ""
"Pada bulan Desember 2014, perangkat lunak pendidikan [GCompris bergabung]"
"(https://dot.kde.org/2014/12/11/gcompris-joins-kde-incubator-and-launches-"
"fundraiser) dengan [inkubator proyek komunitas KDE](https://community.kde."
"org/Incubator). Bruno Coudoin, yang menciptakan [proyek GCompris](http://"
"gcompris.net/index-en.html) pada tahun 2000, memutuskan untuk menulis ulang "
"dalam Qt Quick untuk memfasilitasi penggunaannya pada platform mobile. Pada "
"awalnya ditulis dalam GTK+."

#: content/_index.md:0
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Plasma Mobile"
msgid "Plasma Mobile Announced"
msgstr "Plasma Mobile"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid "Plasma Mobile photo"
msgstr "Foto Plasma Mobile"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid ""
"The community [announced Plasma Mobile](https://dot.kde.org/2015/07/25/"
"plasma-mobile-free-mobile-platform), an interface for smartphones that uses "
"Qt, Frameworks 5 and Plasma Shell technologies."
msgstr ""
"Komunitas [mengumumkan Plasma Mobile](https://dot.kde.org/2015/07/25/plasma-"
"mobile-free-mobile-platform), sebuah antarmuka untuk smartphone yang "
"menggunakan teknologi Qt, Frameworks 5 dan Plasma Shell."

#: content/_index.md:0
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Plasma on Wayland"
msgid "Plasma on Wayland Released"
msgstr "Plasma di Wayland"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid "KWin on Wayland"
msgstr "KWin di Wayland"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid ""
"The [first live image](https://dot.kde.org/2015/12/18/first-plasma-wayland-"
"live-image) of Plasma running on Wayland was made available for download. "
"Since 2011, the community works in support of Wayland by KWin, the "
"Compositor of Plasma, and the Window Manager."
msgstr ""
"[Live image pertama](https://dot.kde.org/2015/12/18/first-plasma-wayland-"
"live-image) dari Plasma yang berjalan di Wayland tersedia untuk diunduh. "
"Sejak tahun 2011, komunitas ini bekerja untuk mendukung Wayland oleh KWin - "
"Compositor Plasma, dan Window Manager."

#: content/_index.md:0
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Plasma 5.5 screenshot"
msgid "Plasma 5.5 Released"
msgstr "Tangkapan layar Plasma 5.5"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid "Plasma 5.5 screenshot"
msgstr "Tangkapan layar Plasma 5.5"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid ""
"Version 5.5 is [announced](https://www.kde.org/announcements/plasma-5.5.0."
"php) with several new features: new icons added to the Breeze theme, support "
"for OpenGL ES in KWin, progress to support Wayland, a new default font "
"(Noto), a new design."
msgstr ""
"Versi 5.5 telah [diumumkan](https://www.kde.org/announcements/plasma-5.5.0."
"php) dengan beberapa fitur baru: ikon baru yang ditambahkan pada tema "
"Breeze, dukungan untuk OpenGL ES pada KWin, kemajuan untuk mendukung "
"Wayland, font default baru (Noto) dengan desain baru."

#: content/_index.md:0
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "KDE Neon"
msgid "KDE Neon Published"
msgstr "KDE Neon"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid "Neon 5.6 screenshot"
msgstr "Tangkapan layar Neon 5.6"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid ""
"The community [announced](https://dot.kde.org/2016/01/30/fosdem-announcing-"
"kde-neon) the inclusion of another project in its incubator, [KDE Neon]"
"(https://neon.kde.org/), based on Ubuntu. Developers, testers, artists, "
"translators and early adopters can get fresh code from git as it is "
"committed by the KDE community."
msgstr ""
"Komunitas ini [mengumumkan](https://dot.kde.org/2016/01/30/fosdem-announcing-"
"kde-neon) penyertaan proyek lain dalam inkubatornya, [KDE Neon](https://neon."
"kde.org/), yang berbasis Ubuntu. Para pengembang, penguji, seniman, "
"penerjemah, dan pengguna awal dapat memperoleh kode baru dari git yang telah "
"di-committ oleh komunitas KDE."

#: content/_index.md:0
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Akademy 2016 part of QtCon"
msgid "Akademy 2016 Held as Part of QtCon"
msgstr "Akademy 2016 bagian dari QtCon"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid "QtCon banner"
msgstr "Banner QtCon"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid ""
"[Akademy 2016](https://akademy.kde.org/2016) took place as a part of [QtCon]"
"(http://qtcon.org/) in September 2016 in Berlin, Germany. The event brought "
"together the Qt, [FSFE](https://fsfe.org/), [VideoLAN](http://www.videolan."
"org/) and KDE communities. It celebrated 20 years of KDE, 20 years of VLC, "
"and 15 years of FSFE."
msgstr ""
"[Akademy 2016](https://akademy.kde.org/2016) berlangsung sebagai bagian dari "
"[QtCon](http://qtcon.org/) pada bulan September 2016 di Berlin, Jerman. "
"Acara ini mempertemukan komunitas Qt, [FSFE](https://fsfe.org/), [VideoLAN]"
"(http://www.videolan.org/) dan KDE. Acara ini merayakan 20 tahun KDE, 20 "
"tahun VLC, dan 15 tahun FSFE."

#: content/_index.md:0
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Kirigami UI"
msgid "Kirigami UI Released"
msgstr "Kirigami UI"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid "Kirigami logo"
msgstr "Logo Kirigami"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid ""
"[Kirigami is released](https://dot.kde.org/2016/03/30/kde-proudly-presents-"
"kirigami-ui), a set of QML components to develop applications based on Qt "
"for mobile or desktop devices."
msgstr ""
"[Kirigami dirilis](https://dot.kde.org/2016/03/30/kde-proudly-presents-"
"kirigami-ui), satu set komponen QML untuk mengembangkan aplikasi berbasis Qt "
"untuk perangkat mobile atau desktop."

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid "KDE presents its Vision for the future"
msgstr "KDE memaparkan Visinya untuk masa depan"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid ""
"In early 2016, as a result of a survey and open discussions among community "
"members, [KDE has published a document outlining its vision for the future]"
"(https://dot.kde.org/2016/04/05/kde-presents-its-vision-future). This vision "
"represents the values that its members consider most important: \"A world in "
"which everyone has control over their digital life and enjoys freedom and "
"privacy.\" The idea in defining this vision was to make clear what are the "
"main motivations that drive the community."
msgstr ""
"Pada awal tahun 2016, sebagai hasil dari survei dan diskusi terbuka di "
"antara anggota komunitas, [KDE telah menerbitkan dokumen yang menguraikan "
"visinya untuk masa depan](https://dot.kde.org/2016/04/05/kde-presents-its-"
"vision-future). Visi ini mewakili nilai-nilai yang dianggap paling penting "
"oleh para anggotanya: \"Sebuah dunia di mana setiap orang memiliki kendali "
"atas kehidupan digital mereka dan menikmati kebebasan dan privasi.\" Gagasan "
"dalam mendefinisikan visi ini adalah untuk memperjelas motivasi utama yang "
"mendorong komunitas."

#: content/_index.md:0
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "KDE was announced"
msgid "KDE 's Advisory Board Announced"
msgstr "KDE diumumkan"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid ""
"In order to formalize the cooperation among the community and the "
"organizations that have been its allies, [KDE e.V. announced the Advisory "
"Board](https://dot.kde.org/2016/09/26/announcing-kde-advisory-board). "
"Through the Advisory Board, organizations can provide feedback on community "
"activities and decisions, to participate in regular meetings with KDE e.V., "
"and to attend to Akademy and community sprints."
msgstr ""
"Dalam rangka memformalkan kerja sama antara komunitas dan organisasi yang "
"telah menjadi mitra, [KDE e.V. mengumumkan Dewan Penasihat](https://dot.kde."
"org/2016/09/26/announcing-kde-advisory-board). Melalui Dewan Penasihat, "
"organisasi-organisasi dapat memberikan umpan balik mengenai kegiatan dan "
"keputusan komunitas, berpartisipasi dalam pertemuan rutin dengan KDE e.V., "
"dan menghadiri Akademy dan sprint komunitas."

#: content/_index.md:0
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "KDE celebrated 20 years"
msgid "KDE Celebrates 20 Years"
msgstr "KDE merayakan 20 tahun"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid "KDE 20 years art by Elias Silveira"
msgstr "Karya seni 20 tahun KDE oleh Elias Silveira"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid ""
"On October 14, KDE celebrated its 20th birthday. The project that started as "
"a desktop environment for Unix systems, today is a community that incubates "
"ideas and projects which go far beyond desktop technologies. To celebrate "
"its anniversary the community [published a book](https://20years.kde.org/"
"book/) written by its contributors. [We also had parties](https://community."
"kde.org/Promo/Events/Parties/KDE_20_Anniversary) been held in eight "
"countries."
msgstr ""
"Pada tanggal 14 Oktober, KDE merayakan ulang tahunnya yang ke-20. Proyek "
"yang dimulai sebagai lingkungan desktop untuk sistem Unix, saat ini menjadi "
"sebuah komunitas yang menginkubasi ide dan proyek yang jauh melampaui "
"teknologi desktop. Untuk merayakan hari jadinya, komunitas ini [menerbitkan "
"sebuah buku](https://20years.kde.org/book/) yang ditulis oleh para "
"kontributornya. [Kami juga mengadakan pesta](https://community.kde.org/Promo/"
"Events/Parties/KDE_20_Anniversary) di delapan negara."

#: content/_index.md:0
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "KDE Slimbook is announced"
msgid "KDE Slimbook Announced"
msgstr "KDE Slimbook diumumkan"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid "KDE Slimbook"
msgstr "KDE Slimbook"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid ""
"In partnership with a Spanish laptop retailer [the community announced the "
"launch of the KDE Slimbook](https://dot.kde.org/2017/01/26/kde-and-slimbook-"
"release-laptop-kde-fans), a ultrabook that comes with the KDE Plasma and KDE "
"Applications pre-installed. The laptop offers a pre-installed version of KDE "
"Neon and [can be purchased from the retailer's website](https://slimbook.es/"
"en/store/slimbook-kde)."
msgstr ""
"Dalam kemitraan dengan peritel laptop asal Spanyol [komunitas ini "
"mengumumkan peluncuran KDE Slimbook](https://dot.kde.org/2017/01/26/kde-and-"
"slimbook-release-laptop-kde-fans), sebuah ultrabook yang telah dilengkapi "
"dengan KDE Plasma dan Aplikasi KDE yang telah terinstal. Laptop ini "
"menawarkan versi pra-instalasi KDE Neon dan [dapat dibeli dari situs web "
"penjual](https://slimbook.es/en/store/slimbook-kde)."

#: content/_index.md:0
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "QtCon Brasil is announced"
msgid "QtCon Brasil Announced"
msgstr "QtCon Brasil diumumkan"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid ""
"Inspired by QtCon 2016, which took place in Berlin and brought together the "
"KDE, VLC, Qt and FSFE communities, [KDE community in Brazil hosted QtCon "
"Brasil in 2017](https://br.qtcon.org/2017/). The event was held in São Paulo "
"and brought together Qt experts from Brazil and abroad in two days of talks "
"and one day of training."
msgstr ""
"Terinspirasi oleh QtCon 2016, yang berlangsung di Berlin dan mempertemukan "
"komunitas KDE, VLC, Qt dan FSFE, [komunitas KDE di Brasil menyelenggarakan "
"QtCon Brasil pada tahun 2017](https://br.qtcon.org/2017/). Acara ini "
"diadakan di São Paulo dan mempertemukan para ahli Qt dari Brasil dan luar "
"negeri dalam dua hari pembicaraan dan satu hari pelatihan."

#: content/_index.md:0
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "KDE set goals"
msgid "KDE Sets Goals"
msgstr "KDE menetapkan tujuan"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid ""
"[KDE sets its goals for the next four years](https://dot.kde.org/2017/11/30/"
"kdes-goals-2018-and-beyond). As part of an effort undertaken by its members "
"since 2015, the community has defined three main objectives for the coming "
"years: to improve the usability and productivity of its software, to ensure "
"that its software helps to preserve the privacy of users and to facilitate "
"the contribution and integration of new collaborators."
msgstr ""
"[KDE menetapkan tujuan untuk empat tahun ke depan](https://dot.kde."
"org/2017/11/30/kdes-goals-2018-and-beyond). Sebagai bagian dari upaya yang "
"dilakukan oleh para anggotanya sejak tahun 2015, komunitas ini telah "
"menetapkan tiga tujuan utama untuk tahun-tahun mendatang: untuk meningkatkan "
"kegunaan dan produktivitas perangkat lunaknya, untuk memastikan bahwa "
"perangkat lunaknya membantu menjaga privasi pengguna dan untuk memfasilitasi "
"kontribusi dan integrasi kolaborator baru."

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid "Debian Joins KDE Advisory Board"
msgstr "Debian Bergabung dengan Dewan Penasihat KDE"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid "Debian Community"
msgstr "Komunitas Debian"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid ""
"Debian, the famous Linux distribution founded in 1993, [joined KDE's "
"Advisory Board](https://dot.kde.org/2018/07/12/debian-joins-kdes-advisory-"
"board) to further deepen the collaboration between both communities. With "
"this, we expect both communities to grow even stronger and to keep working "
"together to build FLOSS projects."
msgstr ""
"Debian, distribusi Linux terkenal yang didirikan pada tahun 1993, [bergabung "
"dengan Dewan Penasihat KDE](https://dot.kde.org/2018/07/12/debian-joins-kdes-"
"advisory-board) untuk lebih memperdalam kolaborasi antara kedua komunitas. "
"Dengan ini, kami berharap kedua komunitas dapat tumbuh lebih kuat lagi dan "
"terus bekerja sama untuk membangun proyek-proyek FLOSS."

#: content/_index.md:0
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "KDE-powered newspaper achieves world first"
msgid "KDE-Powered Newspaper World First"
msgstr "Surat kabar yang didukung KDE pertama di dunia"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid ""
"The *Janayugom* daily newspaper becomes the [first in the world](https://"
"poddery.com/posts/4691002) to switch to a completely free software stack for "
"its publication. The regional paper has 100,000 subscribers across Kerala, "
"India. An event celebrating the move is attended by the state's Chief "
"Minister. Plasma, Okular, Krita, and more are deployed on systems across 14 "
"different offices."
msgstr ""
"Surat kabar harian *Janayugom* menjadi [yang pertama di dunia](https://"
"poddery.com/posts/4691002) yang beralih sepenuhnya ke perangkat lunak bebas "
"untuk penerbitannya. Surat kabar regional ini memiliki 100.000 pelanggan di "
"seluruh Kerala, India. Sebuah acara untuk merayakan perpindahan ini dihadiri "
"oleh Ketua Menteri negara bagian tersebut. Plasma, Okular, Krita, dan banyak "
"lagi digunakan pada sistem di 14 kantor yang berbeda."

#: content/_index.md:0
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "KDE adopts GitLab as an online development platform"
msgid "KDE Adopts GitLab for Online Development"
msgstr "KDE mengadopsi GitLab sebagai platform pengembangan online"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid "KDE adopts GitLab"
msgstr "KDE mengadopsi GitLab"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid ""
"In 2019, [KDE transitioned to GitLab](https://about.gitlab.com/press/"
"releases/2019-09-17-gitlab-adopted-by-KDE.html) as our main DevOps platform. "
"This change allowed the KDE community to work more efficiently and to lower "
"the bar for new contributors to join us. Our GitLab instance can be found "
"[on KDE Invent](https://invent.kde.org)."
msgstr ""
"Pada tahun 2019, [KDE beralih ke GitLab](https://about.gitlab.com/press/"
"releases/2019-09-17-gitlab-adopted-by-KDE.html) sebagai platform DevOps "
"utama kami. Perubahan ini memungkinkan komunitas KDE untuk bekerja lebih "
"efisien dan menurunkan standar bagi kontributor baru untuk bergabung dengan "
"kami. Instance GitLab kami dapat ditemukan [di KDE Invent](https://invent."
"kde.org)."

#: content/_index.md:0
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "New goals for 2019"
msgid "New Goals Set for 2019"
msgstr "Tujuan baru untuk tahun 2019"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid ""
"KDE [announces](https://dot.kde.org/2019/09/07/kde-decides-three-new-"
"challenges-wayland-consistency-and-apps) a new slate of goals for the near "
"future at Akademy 2019. The community has whittled down  a long list of "
"proposals and chose to prioritize a consistent user experience across all "
"KDE software, getting KDE apps into the hands of users with the help of new "
"packaging methods, and improving the Wayland session."
msgstr ""
"KDE [mengumumkan](https://dot.kde.org/2019/09/07/kde-decides-three-new-"
"challenges-wayland-consistency-and-apps) serangkaian tujuan baru untuk waktu "
"dekat di Akademy 2019. Komunitas telah menyusun daftar panjang proposal dan "
"memilih untuk memprioritaskan pengalaman pengguna yang konsisten di seluruh "
"perangkat lunak KDE, membawa aplikasi KDE ke tangan pengguna dengan bantuan "
"metode pengemasan baru, dan meningkatkan sesi Wayland."

#: content/_index.md:0
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "KDE adopts Matrix as an Instant Messaging Platform"
msgid "KDE Adopts Matrix for Instant Messaging"
msgstr "KDE mengadopsi Matrix sebagai Platform Pesan Instan"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid ""
"[Matrix](https://community.kde.org/Matrix), an Open Source, decentralized "
"and secure Instant Messaging platform, became the default and recommended "
"way of communication for those who like their instant messaging graphical. "
"Matrix allows community members to use a web-based, desktop or mobile "
"clients, as well as native KDE clients, such as [Neochat](https://invent.kde."
"org/network/neochat). IRC channels still exist and are bridged to Matrix, "
"ensuring that members using different systems can communicate easily with "
"each other. Likewise Telegram channels, although these are not considered "
"official, as Telegram does not open source the code for its servers or "
"encryption methods."
msgstr ""
"[Matrix](https://community.kde.org/Matrix), sebuah platform Pesan Instan "
"yang bersifat Sumber Terbuka, terdesentralisasi dan aman, menjadi cara "
"komunikasi yang standar dan direkomendasikan bagi mereka yang menyukai pesan "
"instan dengan tampilan grafis. Matrix memungkinkan anggota komunitas untuk "
"menggunakan klien berbasis web, desktop atau seluler, serta klien KDE asli, "
"seperti [Neochat](https://invent.kde.org/network/neochat). Saluran IRC masih "
"ada dan dijembatani ke Matrix, memastikan bahwa anggota yang menggunakan "
"sistem yang berbeda dapat berkomunikasi dengan mudah satu sama lain. "
"Demikian juga saluran Telegram, meskipun ini tidak dianggap resmi, karena "
"Telegram tidak membuka sumber kode untuk server atau metode enkripsinya."

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid "KDE PinePhone Announced"
msgstr "KDE PinePhone Diumumkan"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid "KDE PinePhone"
msgstr "KDE PinePhone"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid ""
"KDE's Plasma Mobile developers team up with [PINE64](https://www.pine64."
"org/) to create the [PinePhone KDE Community Edition](https://www.pine64.org/"
"pinephone/), a mobile phone that runs solely Free Software, is easy to hack "
"and protects your privacy."
msgstr ""
"Pengembang Plasma Mobile KDE bekerja sama dengan [PINE64](https://www.pine64."
"org/) untuk membuat [PinePhone KDE Community Edition](https://www.pine64.org/"
"pinephone/), sebuah ponsel yang hanya menjalankan Perangkat Lunak Bebas, "
"mudah diotak-atik dan melindungi privasi Anda."

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid "GCompris Celebrates 20th Anniversary"
msgstr ""

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid "GCompris in Malayalam"
msgstr "GCompris dalam bahasa Malayalam"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid ""
"In 2020 GCompris celebrated its 20th birthday and was also [deployed in many "
"schools in Kerala, India](https://timotheegiet.com/blog/floss/tales-of-the-"
"kde-network-kerala.html). KDE educational applications have been helping "
"students around the world for decades and are part of the [KDE Educational "
"Project](https://edu.kde.org)."
msgstr ""
"Pada tahun 2020, GCompris merayakan ulang tahunnya yang ke-20 dan juga "
"[digunakan di banyak sekolah di Kerala, India](https://timotheegiet.com/blog/"
"floss/tales-of-the-kde-network-kerala.html). Aplikasi pendidikan KDE telah "
"membantu siswa di seluruh dunia selama beberapa dekade dan merupakan bagian "
"dari [Proyek Pendidikan KDE](https://edu.kde.org)."

#: content/_index.md:0
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Valve chooses KDE Plasma for Steam Deck"
msgid "Valve Chooses KDE Plasma for Steam Deck"
msgstr "Valve memilih KDE Plasma untuk Steam Deck"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid "KDE Plasma running on Steam Deck"
msgstr "KDE Plasma berjalan di Steam Deck"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid ""
"Valve, the creators of Steam, announced their portable gaming computer "
"called Steam Deck has KDE Plasma as the default desktop experience. KDE "
"developers have been working with Valve to make Plasma work well with Steam "
"Deck."
msgstr ""
"Valve, pencipta Steam, mengumumkan komputer gaming portabel mereka yang "
"disebut Steam Deck menggunakan KDE Plasma sebagai pengalaman desktop "
"default. Para pengembang KDE telah bekerja sama dengan Valve untuk membuat "
"Plasma dapat bekerja dengan baik dengan Steam Deck."

#: content/_index.md:0
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "First in-person post-Pandemic Akademy held in Barcelona"
msgid "First In-Person Post-Pandemic Akademy Held in Barcelona"
msgstr ""
"Akademy pasca-Pandemi pertama yang diadakan secara langsung di Barcelona"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid "Attendees to the 2022 Akademy held in Barcelona."
msgstr "Para peserta Akademy 2022 yang diadakan di Barcelona."

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid ""
"Akademy 2022 was held in Barcelona from the 1st to the 7th of October. it "
"was the first time in two years Community members and guests laid out in "
"person what had been going on within KDE's projects (and adjacent projects), "
"the state of the art, and where things were headed."
msgstr ""
"Akademy 2022 diadakan di Barcelona dari tanggal 1 hingga 7 Oktober. Ini "
"adalah pertama kalinya dalam dua tahun terakhir, para anggota komunitas dan "
"peserta menjelaskan secara langsung apa yang telah terjadi dalam proyek-"
"proyek KDE (dan proyek-proyek yang berdekatan), kondisi terkini, dan ke mana "
"arahnya."

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid "KDE Wins at Fundraising"
msgstr ""

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid "Katie and Konqi thank you for your donation."
msgstr "Katie dan Konqi berterima kasih atas donasi Anda."

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid ""
"KDE attempted two new fundraising initiatives in 2022. The first involved "
"[raising funds for a specific app](https://kdenlive.org/en/fund/): Kdenlive, "
"KDE's video editor. Our goal was to raise €15,000 to enable developers to "
"add much-requested features and stabilize the code. The second initiative "
"was [the end-of-year fundraiser](https://kde.org/fundraisers/yearend2022/), "
"where we aimed to raise €20,000. Both fundraisers were massive successes, "
"surpassing the goals we had set. This achievement stands as a testament to "
"the generosity of community members, supporters, and users."
msgstr ""
"KDE mencoba dua inisiatif penggalangan dana baru pada tahun 2022. Yang "
"pertama melibatkan [penggalangan dana untuk aplikasi tertentu](https://"
"kdenlive.org/en/fund/): Kdenlive, editor video KDE. Tujuan kami adalah "
"mengumpulkan €15.000 untuk memungkinkan para pengembang menambahkan fitur-"
"fitur yang banyak diminta dan menstabilkan kodenya. Inisiatif kedua adalah "
"[penggalangan dana akhir tahun](https://kde.org/fundraisers/yearend2022/), "
"di mana kami bertujuan untuk mengumpulkan €20.000. Kedua penggalangan dana "
"tersebut sukses besar, melampaui target yang kami tetapkan. Pencapaian ini "
"merupakan bukti kemurahan hati anggota komunitas, pendukung, dan pengguna."

#: content/_index.md:0
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "The KDE Free Qt Foundation celebrates its 25th anniversary"
msgid "KDE Free Qt Foundation Celebrates 25th Anniversary"
msgstr "Yayasan KDE Free Qt Foundation merayakan ulang tahunnya yang ke-25"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid "The KDE Free Qt Foundation helps keep the Qt toolset free."
msgstr "KDE Free Qt Foundation membantu menjaga agar perangkat Qt tetap bebas."

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid ""
"[The Foundation](https://kde.org/community/whatiskde/kdefreeqtfoundation/) "
"guarantees the present and future freedom of the Qt framework as it has the "
"right to release Qt under the BSD license if necessary to ensure that Qt "
"remains open source. This remarkable legal guarantee protects the free "
"software community and creates trust among developers, contributors, and "
"customers."
msgstr ""
"[Yayasan](https://kde.org/community/whatiskde/kdefreeqtfoundation/) menjamin "
"kebebasan kerangka kerja Qt saat ini dan di masa depan karena memiliki hak "
"untuk merilis Qt di bawah lisensi BSD jika diperlukan untuk memastikan bahwa "
"Qt tetap menjadi sumber terbuka. Jaminan hukum yang luar biasa ini "
"melindungi komunitas perangkat lunak bebas dan menciptakan kepercayaan di "
"antara para pengembang, kontributor, dan pelanggan."

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid "KDE Launches Plasma 6"
msgstr "KDE Meluncurkan Plasma 6"

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid "The default Plasma 6 desktop environment."
msgstr "Lingkungan desktop Plasma 6 standar."

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid ""
"With Plasma 6, our technology stack underwent two major upgrades: a "
"transition to the latest version of our application framework, Qt, and a "
"migration to the modern Linux graphics platform, Wayland. The launch was "
"dubbed \"MegaRelease\", as new versions of KDE's apps and Frameworks, along "
"with a new version of Plasma Mobile were all published at the same time."
msgstr ""
"Dengan Plasma 6, tumpukan teknologi kami mengalami dua peningkatan besar: "
"transisi ke versi terbaru dari kerangka kerja aplikasi kami, Qt, dan migrasi "
"ke platform grafis Linux modern, Wayland. Peluncuran ini dijuluki "
"\"MegaRelease\", karena versi baru dari aplikasi dan kerangka kerja KDE, "
"serta versi baru Plasma Mobile diterbitkan pada saat yang bersamaan."

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid "KDE Linux is born"
msgstr ""

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid "Project Banana was the code name for KDE Linux."
msgstr ""

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid ""
"[KDE Linux](https://kde.org/linux/) is a free, open-source, user-focused "
"operating system being built by KDE to include the best implementation of "
"everything KDE has to offer, using the most advanced technologies."
msgstr ""

